msgid "Selected I/O and clock extension delivery"
msgstr "选定 I/O 与时钟扩展交付"

msgid "This page records development observations for the selected H743, U575 and G474 software extensions and the checks actually executed for them. The current working source has not reached its final freeze. Focused model results below do not qualify a later commit, an ARM image, an electrical connection or a software candidate."
msgstr "本页记录选定 H743、U575 和 G474 软件扩展的开发观察，以及针对它们实际执行的检查。当前工作源码尚未最终冻结。下列专项模型结果不能为后续提交、ARM 镜像、电气连接或软件候选建立资格。"

msgid "The {download}`result index <io-evolution-next-wave-results.json>` identifies the exact fixtures, raw command receipts and fresh XML. The [I/O architecture contract](../design/io-evolution.md) and its FIG-16 explain static assembly and direct runtime dispatch; the [request lifecycle diagram](../assets/diagrams/request-lifecycle.svg) defines borrow and withdrawal transitions. These existing diagrams do not establish qualification of the new selections."
msgstr "{download}`结果索引 <io-evolution-next-wave-results.json>` 标识精确夹具、原始命令回执与新生成的 XML。[I/O 架构合同](../design/io-evolution.md) 及其 FIG-16 说明静态装配与直接运行时派发；[请求生命周期图](../assets/diagrams/request-lifecycle.svg) 定义借用与撤离转换。这些既有图示不建立新增装配的资格。"

