msgid "STM32H743"
msgstr "STM32H743"

msgid "`hsi64-pll384-cache-off`, reviewed V revision, bare-metal reference"
msgstr "`hsi64-pll384-cache-off`、已审 V 修订、裸机参考"

msgid "Explicit cold clock plan, nominal CPU 384 MHz/HCLK 192 MHz/APB 96 MHz with authored HSI bounds; peripheral kernel and timer domains remain distinct. This is a selected reference, not DVFS or a measured clock."
msgstr "显式冷态时钟计划，标称 CPU 384 MHz／HCLK 192 MHz／APB 96 MHz，并带明确编写的 HSI 边界；外设内核与定时器时钟域仍分别定义。这是选定参考，不是 DVFS，也不是实测时钟。"

msgid "STM32U575"
msgstr "STM32U575"

msgid "USART1 `dma-tx`, TZEN=0, MSIS 4 MHz, 8N1"
msgstr "USART1 `dma-tx`, TZEN=0, MSIS 4 MHz, 8N1"

msgid "One selected state and const ops table; GPDMA1/channel0/request25, finite 1–65535-byte TX wholly inside nonsecure SRAM1 `[0x20000000,0x20030000)`. IRQ byte RX remains available; RX DMA, linked lists and a TrustZone broker remain outside this mode."
msgstr "一个选定状态与 const ops 表；GPDMA1/channel0/request25，有限 1–65535 字节 TX 全部位于非安全 SRAM1 `[0x20000000,0x20030000)`。IRQ 字节 RX 仍可用；该模式不包含 RX DMA、链表或 TrustZone broker。"

msgid "STM32G474"
msgstr "STM32G474"

msgid "`can_fd` / `iso-fd-normal` or `iso-fd-loopback`, FDCAN1"
msgstr "`can_fd` / `iso-fd-normal` 或 `iso-fd-loopback`，FDCAN1"

msgid "One fixed 212-word message-RAM slice and three physical TX elements; nominal 500 kbit/s and data 2 Mbit/s at HSE24. Normal and internal-loopback model tests do not qualify a transceiver, terminated bus or peer."
msgstr "一个固定 212 word 消息 RAM 区间与三个物理 TX 元素；HSE24 下标称仲裁速率 500 kbit/s、数据速率 2 Mbit/s。正常模式与内部环回模型测试不为收发器、带终端电阻的总线或对端建立资格。"

msgid "`pwm_adc` / `finite-regular-dma`"
msgstr "`pwm_adc` / `finite-regular-dma`"

msgid "One whole TIM1/ADC1/ADC12/DMA1-channel1/DMAMUX/COMP1 reference owner; 1 MHz counter, 100-tick period, 50-tick trigger and 170 kernel-tick deadtime. Finite halfword samples and the PWM frame remain borrowed through proven withdrawal."
msgstr "一个完整 TIM1/ADC1/ADC12/DMA1-channel1/DMAMUX/COMP1 参考 owner；1 MHz 计数器、100 刻度周期、50 刻度触发与 170 内核刻度死区。有限半字采样与 PWM 帧持续借用，直到撤离得到证明。"

msgid "The authored fixtures choose exact SoC facts and Board routes. Applications, control policies, network protocols, worker tasks, private PCB data and recovery policy remain in external repositories. The platform does not infer electrical thresholds or acceptable actuator behavior from a software fixture."
msgstr "明确编写的夹具选择精确 SoC 事实与 Board 路线。应用、控制策略、网络协议、工作任务、私有 PCB 数据及恢复策略仍位于外部仓库。平台不会从软件夹具推断电气阈值或可接受的执行器行为。"

msgid "Typed factory lookup returns existing immutable faces without hardware access, allocation or a hidden worker. Optional state and private official headers are selected by the assembly. A source selection alone is not a measured Flash/RAM or latency result; final ARM costs require the matching ELF/BIN/map and checks."
msgstr "Typed factory 查询返回既有不可变接口，不访问硬件、不分配，也没有隐藏工作线程。装配选择可选状态与私有官方头文件。仅源码选择不是实测 Flash/RAM 或延迟结果；最终 ARM 成本需要匹配的 ELF/BIN/map 与检查。"

msgid "Completion and failure"
msgstr "完成与失败"

msgid "U575 DMA transfer completion does not imply USART wire completion. The selected mode retains DMAT across requests and cancellation, in accordance with the reviewed U5 erratum. Final settlement requires fresh channel withdrawal/reset proof, independent USART TC and reference drain. Failed drain retains the request in `QUARANTINED`; a timeout does not revoke its source-buffer loan."
msgstr "U575 DMA 传输完成不代表 USART 线上完成。选定模式依据已审 U5 勘误，跨请求与取消保留 DMAT。最终结清需要新鲜的通道撤离／复位证明、独立 USART TC 与引用排空。排空失败时，请求保留在 `QUARANTINED`；超时不会撤销对源缓冲的借用。"

msgid "G474 CAN FD separates pending TX add/request bits from fresh per-element sent or cancellation outcomes. Receive queue capacity does not hide the latched protocol state. G474 PWM/ADC joins timer, ADC, DMA and IRQ references and latches late faults before publishing its final request state. Products must continue service and preserve storage whenever withdrawal fails. See the public API and [finite PWM/ADC contract](../design/pwm-adc.md) for the selected call contexts and physical reference assumptions."
msgstr "G474 CAN FD 将待处理 TX 添加／请求位与新鲜的逐元素发送或取消结果分开。接收队列容量不会掩盖锁存协议状态。G474 PWM/ADC 汇合定时器、ADC、DMA 与 IRQ 引用，并在发布最终请求状态前锁存晚到故障。撤离失败时，产品必须继续服务并保留存储。选定调用上下文与物理参考假设见公共 API 和[有限 PWM/ADC 合同](../design/pwm-adc.md)。"

msgid "Executed generated-factory scopes"
msgstr "已执行的生成工厂范围"

msgid "These five programs resolve the maintained TOML and run generated C together with actual providers on the host. GoogleTest/GoogleMock replaces only external CPU, MMIO, NVIC and explicit bus/event leaves. It does not replace provider admission, drain, factory lookup or platform rollback algorithms."
msgstr "这五个程序解析维护中的 TOML，并在主机上将生成 C 与实际提供者一同运行。GoogleTest/GoogleMock 只替换外部 CPU、MMIO、NVIC 及显式总线／事件叶子，不替换提供者准入、排空、工厂查询或平台回滚算法。"

