msgid "Each suffix belongs to `fixture-io-evolution-SUFFIX`. The empty H743 result uses `nexus_firmware`, not a leftover `io_evolution_fixture` from an earlier failed strong-retention attempt. The other five use `io_evolution_fixture` and have actual passing provider-retention reports. The CAN FD build here is the loopback selection; no normal-bus ARM build is claimed by this table. No cycles, latency, electrical accuracy or dynamic high-water value was measured."
