msgid "Build and dependency delivery"
msgstr "构建与依赖交付"

msgid "Private official inputs add exactly two U5 LL headers (`dma`, `usart`) and three G4 FDCAN-definition headers, including their transitive definitions. Pins, licenses and CMSIS pairing remain checked. The selected closure does not link HAL handles, a vendor tick, vendor IRQ callbacks or a second transfer owner."
msgstr "私有官方输入精确新增两个 U5 LL 头文件（`dma`、`usart`）与三个 G4 FDCAN 定义头文件，包含它们的传递定义。版本锁定、许可与 CMSIS 配对仍被检查。选定闭包不链接 HAL handle、厂商 tick、厂商 IRQ 回调或第二个传输 owner。"

msgid "The source SDK now requires the new public/private I/O modules, coupled configuration code and explicit family payload. `verify_consumers --parallel N` accepts a strict positive job count for every consumer build. Omitting it preserves the previous 4-job base/2-job modern defaults. Its Python regression checks all 13 consumer roots and 16 image targets with external subprocess test doubles; it does not constitute execution of a new real SDK consumer package."
msgstr "源码 SDK 现在要求新的公共／私有 I/O 模块、联合配置代码与显式系列载荷。`verify_consumers --parallel N` 为每个消费者构建接受严格正整数并行任务数。省略时保留既有基础消费者 4 任务、现代消费者 2 任务的默认值。其 Python 回归借助外部子进程替身检查全部 13 个消费者根目录与 16 个镜像目标，不构成新真实 SDK 消费者包的执行。"

msgid "Source and remaining qualification"
msgstr "源码与剩余资格"

msgid "Historical GitHub run [39028022087](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/actions/runs/39028022087) reports 30 completed jobs with scalar `conclusion=\"success\"` for clean source `2963c34aa399c43bea05022eb8846ad2370f0f76`. This is the previous committed source. It does not validate the current working extensions. Job-level documentation success alone also does not establish a newly inspected whole documentation package or prove that every documentation step ran."
msgstr "历史 GitHub 运行 [39028022087](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/actions/runs/39028022087) 为 clean 源码 `2963c34aa399c43bea05022eb8846ad2370f0f76` 报告 30 个已完成任务，标量 `conclusion=\"success\"`。这是上一份已提交源码，不验证当前工作扩展。仅任务级文档成功也不建立新近检查的完整文档包，或证明每个文档步骤均已执行。"

msgid "Before final delivery, bind the frozen source to complete normal hooks, focused final model reruns, exact ARM resource/retention checks, fresh source SDK and independent consumers, and current API/English/Chinese documentation checks. Report each actual result separately. Offline reproduction and a software candidate require their own executed evidence. Physical HIL remains `not_executed`; IO-01–42 ledger status is maintained separately and is not advanced by this page."
msgstr "最终交付前，将冻结源码绑定到完整正常 hooks、最终专项模型重跑、精确 ARM 资源／保留检查、新源码 SDK 与独立消费者，以及当前 API／英文／中文文档检查。逐项报告实际结果。离线复现与软件候选需要各自实际执行的证据。物理 HIL 仍为 `not_executed`；IO-01–42 台账状态单独维护，本页不推进其状态。"
